      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Along their care pathway, children complaining of chronic pain may sometimes be hospitalised. During their stay, health professionals, trained in acute pain management, may find it difficult to deal with this particular syndrome. A specialised unit, comprising notably a pain resource child health nurse, supports the teams to help them understand chronic pain."
      },
